<title>USA: Host Funding acquires Arizona Super 8 motel.</title>
<headline>Host Funding acquires Arizona Super 8 motel.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Host Funding Inc on Friday said it acquired a 90-room Super 8 motel located in Flagstaff, Arizona.</p>
<p>If the Flagstaff property had been included in Host Funding's operations for the full first quarter, the real estate investment trust's pro forma loss would have been $0.04 a share, compared with a loss of $0.16 cents previously reported, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Host Funding was not immediately available to disclose the seller of the hotel and the terms of the deal.</p>
</text>
